      "text": "\u00a7 8. Volunteers. The Fire Department shall be in complete charge of Fire Auxiliaries and keep the necessary records of these units. The Police Department shall be in complete charge of the Police Auxiliaries and the Rescue Service and keep the necessary records of these units.",
